  "goodToKnow": "Der Todesfall is a death, as a case or event: ein Todesfall in der Familie, im Todesfall (in the event of death, a phrase in insurance and wills). Small German shops sometimes put up a sign Wegen Todesfall geschlossen. In statistics, Todesfälle are deaths: die Zahl der Todesfälle. Der Tod is death, and tot means dead. Condolences are expressed with Mein herzliches Beileid. Plural: die Todesfälle."
